# android/ is COMMITTED (source) so the APK builds reproducibly in CI. Generated/secret bits are
# excluded by android/.gitignore (.gradle, build/, local.properties, keystores). The other native
# folders aren't built yet → still generated locally via `flutter create .`.
ios/
linux/
macos/
windows/
# web/ + android/ are committed; web/ also carries custom _headers, favicon, index.html.

